{"repositoryId":1373507287,"availability":"available","full":"chinazaaa/Sudu-delivery-","name":"Sudu-delivery-","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-16T18:46:16Z","updated":"2026-10-12T06:23:38Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sudu-delivery.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://sudu-delivery.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.831Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.831Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.831Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.831Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Batched food delivery from Sangotedo to Pan-Atlantic University. Students order from KFC and Domino's, orders are batched into a run, one driver collects them physically and hands them out at a fixed campus drop point. One price covers food and delivery, paid in advance.","This repo is the smallest thing that removes the WhatsApp mess: a menu, a cart, a batch cut-off, and the admin screen the driver reads at the counter.","4-6 ₦6,000, 7-10 ₦8,000, 11+ ₦10,000. One ₦24,000 bucket is one container and pays the headline ₦4,000. The cart shows the count, the fee and how far the next band is"],"features":["Menu across multiple restaurants, with items mixable in one cart and one fee","Delivery priced by container count, not food value. 1-3 items ₦4,000,","Group orders. One cart for several people, each item tagged with a name","Adding to an order later in the week: same phone, same batch, merged","Batch selector defaulting to the next open batch, with a live two-line"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chinazaaa/Sudu-delivery-/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"519fc9130f1ce81f33d40957102fccd1eb939733919747c1c34b70cf19fa898c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:12.082Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:12.082Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Batched